---
const tags = [
  { label: 'cuerpo', color: 'coral' },
  { label: 'arte', color: 'violet' },
  { label: 'movimiento', color: 'blue' },
  { label: 'comunidad', color: 'yellow' },
  { label: 'talleres', color: 'pink' },
  { label: 'encuentros', color: 'ink' },
];
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <!-- Background art -->
  <div class="about__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="about__bg-ring"></div>
    <div class="about__bg-circle"></div>
    <div class="about__bg-dot"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__grid">
      <!-- Left: minimal decorative card -->
      <div class="about__visual reveal">
        <div class="about__card">
          <div class="about__card-inner">
            <p class="about__card-text">Un lugar que se activa con personas.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="about__card-accent" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: text content -->
      <div class="about__content">
        <h2 class="section-title reveal">¿Qué es <span class="about__highlight">Soma</span>?</h2>

        <div class="about__text reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p>
            Soma es un espacio que se activa con personas. Un lugar para talleres, 
            encuentros y procesos creativos donde se cruzan cuerpo, arte, movimiento 
            y comunidad.
          </p>
          <p>
            No es un centro. Es un punto de encuentro.<br/>
            Un atelier compartido que existe cuando lo habitamos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__tags reveal reveal-delay-2">
          {tags.map((tag) => (
            <span class={`tag ${tag.color === 'ink' ? '' : `tag--${tag.color}`}`}>{tag.label}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Background art */
  .about__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .about__bg-ring {
    position: absolute;
    width: 350px;
    height: 350px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2.5px solid var(--violet);
    opacity: 0.08;
    top: -60px;
    right: -80px;
  }

  .about__bg-circle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--yellow);
    opacity: 0.06;
    bottom: -40px;
    left: -60px;
  }

  .about__bg-dot {
    position: absolute;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--coral);
    bottom: 25%;
    right: 12%;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Card — minimal, cream/white, ink border */
  .about__visual {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about__card {
    background: #fff;
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    max-width: 280px;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about__card:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.02);
  }

  .about__card-inner {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about__card-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .about__card-accent {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    right: -10px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--coral);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  /* Content */
  .about__highlight {
    color: var(--coral);
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .about__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .about__text p {
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .about__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .about__visual {
      order: 2;
    }

    .about__card {
      max-width: 260px;
    }
  }
</style>
